# openspec/ is a whole directory, unlike the per-file lines above. It holds one
# file, config.yaml, `store: sessionvoice`: a pointer that sends the openspec CLI
# to the project's OpenSpec store, where the specs live. That store is private,
# so the pointer means nothing to a reader of the archive. A pattern that
# matches a directory does not match the paths inside it, so `/openspec/**`
# drops each file and `/openspec` drops the directory entry that would otherwise
# be left in the archive, empty. To ship the pointer, delete the two lines.
/openspec export-ignore
/openspec/** export-ignore
